@startuml
title Template generation
autonumber

actor Caller
participant TemplateApplication as App
participant "Domain" as Domain
participant "ModelProvider" as Provider
participant ValidationPipeline as Validator
participant "Check" as Check
participant "Tool" as Tool

Caller -> App: create_validated_template(request, domain, provider)
note right of App
  We can allow an optional field for users to
  have more control over the generation
end note

App -> Domain: generation_request(request)
Domain --> App: Generation specification\n(messages, response schema, parser)

App -> Provider: generate(specification)
note right of Provider
  Call model and decode response
  using the supplied response contract
end note
Provider --> App: Proposal

App -> Domain: build_candidate(request, proposal)
note right of Domain
  Combine request settings and proposal
  Derive domain-owned fields (Types for code etc)
  Add fallback distractor candidates
end note
Domain --> App: Candidate

App -> Domain: prepare_validation(candidate, request)
note right of Domain
  Create shared domain context
  Choose checks and their order
  Define required-check policy
end note
Domain --> App: ValidationPlan(context, checks, policy)

App -> Validator: validate(plan)

loop Each check in plan order, until failure
    Validator -> Check: run(context)

    opt Check requires a tool
        Check -> Tool: Execute operation
        Tool --> Check: Tool result
    end

    Check --> Validator: CheckResult(status, findings)
    Validator -> Validator: Record evidence and duration

    opt Check failed or could not complete
        Validator -> Validator: Record failure and stop iteration
    end
end

Validator --> App: ValidationReport

alt Validation rejected
    App --> Caller: Validation failure with evidence
else All required checks passed
    App -> Domain: finalize_template(plan.context, report)
    note right of Domain
      Package checked values
      Store canonical answers from context
      Retain selected distractors and evidence
      Clear proposed answer expression
    end note
    Domain --> App: Validated template

    App -> App: Attach authoring provenance
    App --> Caller: Validated template
end
@enduml